#: includes/class-wcll-gateway.php:11
msgid ""
"Accept Bitcoin Lightning payments through a Lightning Address with LUD-21 "
"settlement verification, and configure LaWallet discovery from the main "
"settings page."
msgstr ""
"Acepta pagos Bitcoin Lightning a través de una Lightning Address con "
"verificación de liquidación LUD-21, y configura el descubrimiento de "
"LaWallet desde la página principal de ajustes."

#: includes/class-wcll-gateway.php:20 includes/class-wcll-gateway.php:46
#: templates/payment-page.php:85
msgid "LaWallet Lightning"
msgstr "LaWallet Lightning"

#: includes/class-wcll-gateway.php:21
msgid "Pay instantly with a Bitcoin Lightning wallet."
msgstr "Paga al instante con una billetera Bitcoin Lightning."

#: includes/class-wcll-gateway.php:29
msgid "Enable/Disable"
msgstr "Activar/Desactivar"

#: includes/class-wcll-gateway.php:31
msgid "Enable Bitcoin Lightning payments"
msgstr "Activar pagos Bitcoin Lightning"

#: includes/class-wcll-gateway.php:35 includes/class-wcll-gateway.php:161
msgid "Lightning Address"
msgstr "Lightning Address"

#: includes/class-wcll-gateway.php:37
msgid ""
"Merchant Lightning Address. It must support LNURL-pay and LUD-21 verify."
msgstr ""
"Lightning Address del comerciante. Debe ser compatible con LNURL-pay y con "
"la verificación LUD-21."

#: includes/class-wcll-gateway.php:43
msgid "Checkout title"
msgstr "Título en el checkout"

#: includes/class-wcll-gateway.php:45
msgid "Payment method name shown to customers."
msgstr "Nombre del método de pago que ven los clientes."

#: includes/class-wcll-gateway.php:50
msgid "Checkout description"
msgstr "Descripción en el checkout"

#: includes/class-wcll-gateway.php:52
msgid "Scan a Lightning invoice QR code or open it in your Lightning wallet."
msgstr ""
"Escanea el código QR de la factura Lightning o ábrela en tu billetera "
"Lightning."

#: includes/class-wcll-gateway.php:55
msgid "Invoice expiry minutes"
msgstr "Minutos de expiración de la factura"

#: includes/class-wcll-gateway.php:64
msgid "NIP-57 relay URLs"
msgstr "URLs de relays NIP-57"

#: includes/class-wcll-gateway.php:66
msgid "Optional relay URLs used to listen for zap receipts. One URL per line."
msgstr ""
"URLs opcionales de relays para escuchar recibos zap. Una URL por línea."

#: includes/class-wcll-gateway.php:71 includes/class-wcll-gateway.php:166
#: includes/class-wcll-gateway.php:700
msgid "NWC proxy wallet"
msgstr "Billetera proxy NWC"

#: includes/class-wcll-gateway.php:73
msgid ""
"Settle through an NWC proxy wallet when the Lightning Address cannot confirm"
" payments"
msgstr ""
"Liquidar a través de una billetera proxy NWC cuando la Lightning Address no "
"puede confirmar pagos"

#: includes/class-wcll-gateway.php:74
msgid ""
"Required only for Lightning Addresses that support neither LUD-21 "
"verification nor NIP-57 zap receipts. The plugin invoices an NWC (NIP-47) "
"wallet, then forwards the funds to your Lightning Address minus a small "
"routing reserve."
msgstr ""
"Solo es necesario para Lightning Address que no admiten ni la verificación "
"LUD-21 ni los recibos zap NIP-57. El plugin genera una factura en una "
"billetera NWC (NIP-47) y luego reenvía los fondos a tu Lightning Address "
"menos una pequeña reserva para comisiones de ruteo."

#: includes/class-wcll-gateway.php:78
msgid "NWC wallet mode"
msgstr "Modo de billetera NWC"

#: includes/class-wcll-gateway.php:80
msgid ""
"Disposable: the plugin creates a throwaway wallet on demand and replaces it "
"when it dies. Permanent: you provide a fixed connection string that is never"
" replaced."
msgstr ""
"Descartable: el plugin crea una billetera de un solo uso cuando se necesita "
"y la reemplaza cuando muere. Permanente: tú proporcionas una cadena de "
"conexión fija que nunca se reemplaza."

#: includes/class-wcll-gateway.php:83
msgid "Disposable (auto-created)"
msgstr "Descartable (creada automáticamente)"

#: includes/class-wcll-gateway.php:84
msgid "Permanent (your own connection)"
msgstr "Permanente (tu propia conexión)"

#: includes/class-wcll-gateway.php:89
msgid "Disposable wallet service (lncurl)"
msgstr "Servicio de billeteras descartables (lncurl)"

#: includes/class-wcll-gateway.php:91
msgid ""
"Used in Disposable mode. An lncurl service that mints a wallet from a single"
" request. Defaults to https://lncurl.lol."
msgstr ""
"Se usa en modo Descartable. Un servicio lncurl que genera una billetera con "
"una sola solicitud. Por defecto https://lncurl.lol."

#: includes/class-wcll-gateway.php:97
msgid "Auto-replace dead wallet"
msgstr "Reemplazar automáticamente la billetera muerta"

#: includes/class-wcll-gateway.php:99
msgid ""
"Provision a new wallet when the current disposable wallet becomes "
"unavailable"
msgstr ""
"Provisiona una nueva billetera cuando la billetera descartable actual deja "
"de estar disponible"

#: includes/class-wcll-gateway.php:100
msgid "Disposable mode only. A permanent connection is never replaced."
msgstr "Solo en modo Descartable. Una conexión permanente nunca se reemplaza."

#: includes/class-wcll-gateway.php:104
msgid "Permanent NWC connection string"
msgstr "Cadena de conexión NWC permanente"

#: includes/class-wcll-gateway.php:106
msgid ""
"Used in Permanent mode: a nostr+walletconnect:// string for a wallet you "
"control. It is stored securely on the server (not in the settings form) and "
"is not shown again after saving; leave blank to keep the current one. Never "
"exposed to customers. Leave blank in Disposable mode."
msgstr ""
"Se usa en modo Permanente: una cadena nostr+walletconnect:// de una "
"billetera que controlas. Se almacena de forma segura en el servidor (no en "
"el formulario de ajustes) y no se vuelve a mostrar después de guardar; "
"déjalo en blanco para conservar la actual. Nunca se expone a los clientes. "
"Déjalo en blanco en modo Descartable."

#: includes/class-wcll-gateway.php:112
msgid "Manual sats per currency unit"
msgstr "Sats manuales por unidad de moneda"

#: includes/class-wcll-gateway.php:114
msgid ""
"Optional. Leave blank to use Yadio BTC exchange rates for fiat currencies."
msgstr ""
"Opcional. Déjalo en blanco para usar los tipos de cambio de BTC de Yadio "
"para monedas fiat."

#: includes/class-wcll-gateway.php:119
msgid "Rate display unit"
msgstr "Unidad de visualización del tipo de cambio"

#: includes/class-wcll-gateway.php:121
msgid ""
"Choose whether the locked Yadio rate is shown as a BTC price or a SAT price "
"on the payment page."
msgstr ""
"Elige si el tipo de cambio bloqueado de Yadio se muestra como precio en BTC "
"o en SAT en la página de pago."

#: includes/class-wcll-gateway.php:124
msgid "BTC"
msgstr "BTC"

#: includes/class-wcll-gateway.php:125
msgid "SATS"
msgstr "SATS"

#: includes/class-wcll-gateway.php:130
msgid "Price buffer percent"
msgstr "Porcentaje de margen de precio"

#: includes/class-wcll-gateway.php:139
msgid "Local development HTTP"
msgstr "HTTP para desarrollo local"

#: includes/class-wcll-gateway.php:141
msgid "Allow HTTP Lightning Address endpoints for local development"
msgstr "Permitir endpoints HTTP de Lightning Address para desarrollo local"

#: includes/class-wcll-gateway.php:142
msgid "Keep this disabled in production."
msgstr "Mantén esto desactivado en producción."

#: includes/class-wcll-gateway.php:156
msgid "Checkout"
msgstr "Pago"

#: includes/class-wcll-gateway.php:157
msgid ""
"Enable the gateway and control how it appears to customers at checkout."
msgstr ""
"Activa la pasarela y controla cómo se muestra a los clientes al finalizar la"
" compra."

#: includes/class-wcll-gateway.php:162
msgid ""
"Your merchant Lightning Address, plus the Nostr relays used to confirm "
"payments via NIP-57 zap receipts."
msgstr ""
"Tu Lightning Address de comercio, además de los relays de Nostr usados para "
"confirmar pagos mediante recibos zap NIP-57."

#: includes/class-wcll-gateway.php:167
msgid ""
"Optional fallback for Lightning Addresses that support neither LUD-21 nor "
"NIP-57. Payments settle on an NWC wallet and are forwarded to your Lightning"
" Address."
msgstr ""
"Alternativa opcional para Lightning Address que no admiten ni LUD-21 ni "
"NIP-57. Los pagos se liquidan en una billetera NWC y se reenvían a tu "
"Lightning Address."

#: includes/class-wcll-gateway.php:171
msgid "Pricing & rates"
msgstr "Precios y tipos de cambio"

#: includes/class-wcll-gateway.php:172
msgid ""
"How fiat order totals are converted to satoshis and shown on the payment "
"page."
msgstr ""
"Cómo se convierten los totales de pedidos en moneda fiat a satoshis y cómo "
"se muestran en la página de pago."

#: includes/class-wcll-gateway.php:176
msgid "Advanced"
msgstr "Avanzado"

#: includes/class-wcll-gateway.php:177
msgid ""
"Developer and local-environment options. Leave these alone in production."
msgstr ""
"Opciones para desarrolladores y entornos locales. Déjalas como están en "
"producción."

#: includes/class-wcll-gateway.php:192
msgid "Easiest"
msgstr "Lo más fácil"

#: includes/class-wcll-gateway.php:193
msgid ""
"The simplest way to start: download, get a Lightning Address, and receive in"
" seconds."
msgstr ""
"La forma más sencilla de empezar: descarga, obtén una Lightning Address y "
"recibe en segundos."

#: includes/class-wcll-gateway.php:200
msgid "Nostr native"
msgstr "Nativo de Nostr"

#: includes/class-wcll-gateway.php:201
msgid "A Nostr social client with a built-in Lightning wallet and address."
msgstr ""
"Un cliente social de Nostr con billetera Lightning y dirección integradas."

#: includes/class-wcll-gateway.php:208
msgid "Most popular"
msgstr "Más popular"

#: includes/class-wcll-gateway.php:209
msgid ""
"One of the most widely used Bitcoin apps, with Lightning Addresses across "
"many regions."
msgstr ""
"Una de las apps de Bitcoin más usadas, con Lightning Address en muchas "
"regiones."

#: includes/class-wcll-gateway.php:216
msgid "Self custody"
msgstr "Autocustodia"

#: includes/class-wcll-gateway.php:217
msgid ""
"A self-custodial Lightning wallet and browser extension for the open web."
msgstr ""
"Una billetera Lightning autocustodiada y extensión de navegador para la web "
"abierta."

#: includes/class-wcll-gateway.php:224
msgid "Good for merchants"
msgstr "Buena para comercios"

#: includes/class-wcll-gateway.php:225
msgid "A popular Bitcoin wallet, great for merchants and everyday payments."
msgstr ""
"Una billetera de Bitcoin popular, ideal para comercios y pagos cotidianos."

#: includes/class-wcll-gateway.php:232
msgid "Own infrastructure"
msgstr "Infraestructura propia"

#: includes/class-wcll-gateway.php:233
msgid "Run your own Lightning accounts and addresses on your infrastructure."
msgstr ""
"Gestiona tus propias cuentas y direcciones Lightning en tu infraestructura."

#: includes/class-wcll-gateway.php:244
msgid "Set your Lightning Address to start accepting Lightning payments."
msgstr ""
"Configura tu Lightning Address para empezar a aceptar pagos Lightning."

#: includes/class-wcll-gateway.php:245
msgid ""
"Saving this page creates a test invoice and confirms the address supports "
"LUD-21 verification or NIP-57 zap receipts."
msgstr ""
"Al guardar esta página se crea una factura de prueba y se confirma que la "
"dirección admite la verificación LUD-21 o los recibos zap NIP-57."

#: includes/class-wcll-gateway.php:297
msgid "See compatible wallets"
msgstr "Ver billeteras compatibles"

#: includes/class-wcll-gateway.php:299
msgid "Customers can pay from any wallet that gives them a Lightning Address."
msgstr ""
"Los clientes pueden pagar desde cualquier billetera que les dé una Lightning"
" Address."

#: includes/class-wcll-gateway.php:326
msgid "Lightning Address must look like name@example.com."
msgstr "La Lightning Address debe tener el formato nombre@ejemplo.com."

#: includes/class-wcll-gateway.php:342
msgid "Manual sats per currency unit must be greater than zero."
msgstr "Los sats manuales por unidad de moneda deben ser mayores que cero."

#: includes/class-wcll-gateway.php:401
msgid "The lncurl service must be a valid http(s) URL."
msgstr "El servicio lncurl debe ser una URL http(s) válida."

#: includes/class-wcll-gateway.php:441
msgid "Payment error: order could not be loaded."
msgstr "Error de pago: no se pudo cargar el pedido."

#: includes/class-wcll-gateway.php:448
msgid "Payment error: merchant Lightning Address is not configured."
msgstr ""
"Error de pago: la Lightning Address del comerciante no está configurada."

#: includes/class-wcll-gateway.php:454 includes/class-wcll-gateway.php:463
#: includes/class-wcll-gateway.php:477
msgid "Payment error:"
msgstr "Error de pago:"

#: includes/class-wcll-gateway.php:504
msgid ""
"Payment error: this Lightning Address cannot confirm payments. It returned "
"no LUD-21 verify URL and does not support NIP-57 zap receipts."
msgstr ""
"Error de pago: esta Lightning Address no puede confirmar pagos. No devolvió "
"una URL de verificación LUD-21 y no admite recibos zap NIP-57."

#: includes/class-wcll-gateway.php:511
msgid "Payment error: the NWC proxy wallet returned an incomplete invoice."
msgstr ""
"Error de pago: la billetera proxy NWC devolvió una factura incompleta."

#: includes/class-wcll-gateway.php:552
msgid "Awaiting Bitcoin Lightning payment."
msgstr "Esperando el pago Bitcoin Lightning."

#: includes/class-wcll-gateway.php:577
msgid "Lightning Address is required."
msgstr "La Lightning Address es obligatoria."

#: includes/class-wcll-gateway.php:598
msgid ""
"No LUD-21 verify URL; payments will be confirmed via NIP-57 zap receipts."
msgstr ""
"Sin URL de verificación LUD-21; los pagos se confirmarán mediante recibos "
"zap NIP-57."

#: includes/class-wcll-gateway.php:601
msgid "Lightning Address will be confirmed via NIP-57 zap receipts."
msgstr "La Lightning Address se confirmará mediante recibos zap NIP-57."

#: includes/class-wcll-gateway.php:626
msgid "Enable and configure the NWC proxy wallet to accept this address."
msgstr ""
"Habilita y configura la billetera proxy NWC para aceptar esta dirección."

